{"compact": {"ja_sv": "Utskottets förslag: att avslå motionsyrkandena (nuvarande ordning behålls).", "nej_sv": "Stöd för motförslaget: reservation 6 från S.", "avstar_sv": "Partiet markerar en egen linje som inte finns med i slutomröstningens två alternativ.", "ja_en": "The committee proposal: rejecting the motions (keeping things as they are).", "nej_en": "Backing the counter-proposal: reservation 6 by S.", "avstar_en": "The party marks a position of its own that is not one of the two final alternatives."}, "en": {"rubrik": "Priorities", "dok_titel": "International development assistance", "forslag_text": "The Riksdag rejects the motions \n\n2022/23:53 by Lotta Johnsson Fornarve et al. (V), item 21, \n\n2022/23:612 by Nooshi Dadgostar et al. (V), item 16, \n\n2022/23:1455 by Jacob Risberg and Bassem Nasr (both MP), item 5, \n\n2022/23:1462 by Amanda Lind et al. (MP), items 3 and 4, \n\n2022/23:1745 by Alexander Christiansson et al. (SD), item 14, \n\n2022/23:1749 by Mats Nordberg et al. (SD), items 1-3, 9, 10, 14, 15, 17-30 and 44, \n\n2022/23:1752 by Markus Wiechel et al. (SD), items 1 and 12, \n\n2022/23:1758 by Markus Wiechel et al. (SD), items 6, 7 and 9, \n\n2022/23:1783 by Aron Emilsson et al. (SD), items 3-5, \n\n2022/23:1879 by Kerstin Lundgren et al. (C), items 2-4, 6, 10, 12-20, 24, 26, 27 and 30-32, \n\n2022/23:2042 by Morgan Johansson et al. (S), item 2, \n\n2022/23:2064 by Fredrik Olovsson et al. (S), item 19, \n\n2022/23:2190 by Annie Lööf et al. (C), items 17-21, \n\n2022/23:2261 by Janine Alm Ericson et al. (MP), items 2-4, 7, 9-12, 15, 17-19, 24 and 25, and \n\n2022/23:2277 by Märta Stenevi et al. (MP), item 65.", "notis": "The Riksdag rejected approximately 100 proposals on international assistance. The proposals were submitted during the general motion period of 2022.\nThe motions concern, among other things, the level of aid, the regulations of the OECD's Development Assistance Committee (DAC), and priorities within international development assistance. The Riksdag rejects the motions, among other things, because investigative work is under way in this area.", "alternatives": ["The Riksdag rejects the motions \n\n2022/23:53 by Lotta Johnsson Fornarve et al. (V), item 21, \n\n2022/23:612 by Nooshi Dadgostar et al. (V), item 16, \n\n2022/23:1455 by Jacob Risberg and Bassem Nasr (both MP), item 5, \n\n2022/23:1462 by Amanda Lind et al. (MP), items 3 and 4, \n\n2022/23:1745 by Alexander Christiansson et al. (SD), item 14, \n\n2022/23:1749 by Mats Nordberg et al. (SD), items 1-3, 9, 10, 14, 15, 17-30 and 44, \n\n2022/23:1752 by Markus Wiechel et al. (SD), items 1 and 12, \n\n2022/23:1758 by Markus Wiechel et al. (SD), items 6, 7 and 9, \n\n2022/23:1783 by Aron Emilsson et al. (SD), items 3-5, \n\n2022/23:1879 by Kerstin Lundgren et al. (C), items 2-4, 6, 10, 12-20, 24, 26, 27 and 30-32, \n\n2022/23:2042 by Morgan Johansson et al. (S), item 2, \n\n2022/23:2064 by Fredrik Olovsson et al. (S), item 19, \n\n2022/23:2190 by Annie Lööf et al. (C), items 17-21, \n\n2022/23:2261 by Janine Alm Ericson et al. (MP), items 2-4, 7, 9-12, 15, 17-19, 24 and 25, and \n\n2022/23:2277 by Märta Stenevi et al. (MP), item 65.", "Reservation 6"]}, "votering_id": "9312F7C2-040D-4326-93E3-5927C0ED570D", "rm": "2022/23", "beteckning": "UU6", "punkt": 3, "dok_id": "HA01UU6", "datum": "2023-04-12", "utskott": "UU", "rubrik": "Prioriteringar", "dok_titel": "Internationellt utvecklingsbistånd", "sammanfattning": "Utrikesutskottet föreslår att riksdagen säger nej till cirka 100 förslag som handlar om internationellt bistånd. Förslagen har lämnats in under den allmänna motionstiden 2022.\nMotionerna handlar bland annat om nivån på biståndet, OECD:s kommitté för bistånds regelverk och prioriteringar inom internationellt utvecklingsbistånd. Utskottet föreslår att motionerna ska avslås bland annat eftersom utredningsarbete inom området pågår.", "forslag_text": "Riksdagen avslår motionerna \n\n2022/23:53 av Lotta Johnsson Fornarve m.fl. (V) yrka